{"name": "Rogue Slime: PC Edition", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROGUE SLIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A turn-based roguelite driven by a unique item-based combat system. Manage your resources, optimize your build, navigate branching paths, and restore your village between runs. Every run is different. Every build changes how you play!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique energy-based combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue-lite structure with node-based maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random events and difficult choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Persistent Village building and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distinct and adorable 3D slime visual style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CORE COMBAT SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/14213e7839ddc240aaab9c51ce67c214.poster.avif?t=1776176209\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/14213e7839ddc240aaab9c51ce67c214.webm?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/14213e7839ddc240aaab9c51ce67c214.mp4?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distribute your energies into item slots to charge them up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items activate automatically when their energy slots are full to deal damage, apply effects, or modify other items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SEMI-PROCEDURAL MAP EXPLORATION<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/1af1c699bee647ac6aa8e79791e71990.poster.avif?t=1776176209\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/1af1c699bee647ac6aa8e79791e71990.webm?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/1af1c699bee647ac6aa8e79791e71990.mp4?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Node-based maps</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Treasure chests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blacksmiths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resources</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANDOM EVENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/0aa56b8ece7d13d401a337e79dbdd243.poster.avif?t=1776176209\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/0aa56b8ece7d13d401a337e79dbdd243.webm?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439030/extras/0aa56b8ece7d13d401a337e79dbdd243.mp4?t=1776176209\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout each run, you will encounter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Risk and reward events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Item upgrades</p></li><li><p 